Purpose: Restore archived sessions without reading unrelated active or archived rollout contents.

Requires: none

Provides: Select archived files for the requested thread through the native filename-filtered scanner, retaining metadata ownership checks and every reverted or compressed owned rollout; archive uses the same scanner with active storage.

Boundary: Preserve lifecycle and cross-process writer locks, selected SQLite paths, canonical storage guards, move rollback, metadata updates and restored thread presentation; retain complete reference scans for deletion and compression.

Verification: Filtered rollout tests cover active and archived storage, reverted and compressed files, unrelated exclusion and candidate ownership; archive and unarchive tests preserve file moves, metadata and writer exclusion, while the retained profile batch measures continuous application.


